# Consistent line endings for a mixed-OS team
* text=auto
*.md text eol=lf

# Concurrency guardrails for shared wiki state #################################

# wiki/log.md is append-only. Union merge keeps BOTH sides' entries on
# conflict, so concurrent ingests by teammates never clobber each other.
wiki/log.md merge=union

# wiki/index.md is reconstructed by `lint` (missing entries are a safe-fix).
# Union merge prevents a merge conflict from silently dropping a teammate's
# entry; duplicates, if they ever appear, are trivial to clean up.
wiki/index.md merge=union

# raw/ files are unique per source (date + slug); no special merge needed.
